IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0029.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY PEN0029C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 PENALTY-WAIVED     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-WAIVED=" PENALTY-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN CUST-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
                MOVE 0.00 TO LATE-CHARGE
            WHEN DAYS-PAST-DUE <= 5
                MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
